                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Tyler to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-05-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 18,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Tyler reports that Mir Ghaffar, the murderer of Mr. Labaree, was arrested
                    yesterday.)</p>
            </div>
